<div class="live-pill"><span></span> Admissions and public learning are open</div>
<span class="eyebrow">A connected digital campus</span>
<h1>Learning that feels <em>alive</em>, personal and limitless.</h1>
<p>A modern LMS for schools, colleges and universities—bringing courses, live classes, collaboration, analytics and student success into one beautiful experience.</p>
<div class="actions hero-actions"><a class="button button-xl" href="{{{url_role_login}}}">Start your journey <span>↗</span></a><a class="watch-link" href="{{{url_course_player}}}"><span class="play-orb">▶</span><span><b>Watch platform tour</b><small>2 min interactive preview</small></span></a></div>
<div class="trust-row"><div class="avatar-stack"><span>AK</span><span>RM</span><span>SP</span><span>+2k</span></div><div><b>Trusted by growing learning communities</b><small>Students, educators, parents and administrators</small></div></div>
</div>
