<div class="floating-card fc-progress"><span class="mini-icon">◔</span><div><b>Learning progress</b><small>Weekly goal reached</small></div><strong>84%</strong></div>
<div class="floating-card fc-live"><span class="pulse-dot"></span><div><b>Live class now</b><small>Advanced Mathematics</small></div></div>
<div class="floating-card fc-badge"><span>🏆</span><div><b>New achievement</b><small>7-day learning streak</small></div></div>
</div>
