<article><span class="metric-icon">▤</span><strong data-counter="{{coursecount}}">0</strong><small>Interactive courses</small></article>
<article><span class="metric-icon">✦</span><strong data-counter="98">0</strong><small>Learner satisfaction</small></article>
<article><span class="metric-icon">◷</span><strong data-counter="24">0</strong><small>Always-on access</small></article>
