<div class="programme-grid">
<a class="programme-card pc-blue reveal" href="{{{url_course}}}"><span class="programme-icon">⚛</span><div><small>Science &amp; research</small><h3>Future Scientists</h3><p>Experiments, simulations and collaborative discovery.</p></div><span class="arrow-chip">↗</span></a>
<a class="programme-card pc-purple reveal" href="{{{url_course_player}}}"><span class="programme-icon">◈</span><div><small>Digital technology</small><h3>Code &amp; Create</h3><p>Programming, design thinking and digital production.</p></div><span class="arrow-chip">↗</span></a>
<a class="programme-card pc-orange reveal" href="{{{url_activities}}}"><span class="programme-icon">⌁</span><div><small>Business &amp; leadership</small><h3>Young Innovators</h3><p>Entrepreneurship, communication and real-world projects.</p></div><span class="arrow-chip">↗</span></a>
<a class="programme-card pc-green reveal" href="{{{url_my_courses}}}"><span class="programme-icon">✿</span><div><small>Arts &amp; humanities</small><h3>Creative Expression</h3><p>Stories, cultures, media and meaningful creative work.</p></div><span class="arrow-chip">↗</span></a>
