<article class="experience-slide active"><div class="slide-copy"><span class="slide-number">01</span><span class="role-chip student">Student experience</span><h3>Stay focused with a learning space that knows what comes next.</h3><p>Personal dashboards, intelligent next steps, progress goals, achievements and an immersive course player keep momentum visible.</p><ul><li>Personal course feed</li><li>Smart deadlines and reminders</li><li>Progress, grades and badges</li></ul><a href="{{{url_login_student}}}">Explore student login →</a></div><img alt="Immersive student course player" height="1024" src="{{{pix_showcase_course_player}}}" width="1536"/></article>
<article class="experience-slide"><div class="slide-copy"><span class="slide-number">02</span><span class="role-chip teacher">Educator experience</span><h3>Teach, assess and support learners without losing your flow.</h3><p>Course authoring, grading workflows, learner insights and communication tools come together in one clear workspace.</p><ul><li>Visual course builder</li><li>Fast grading and feedback</li><li>Actionable learning analytics</li></ul><a href="{{{url_login_teacher}}}">Explore teacher login →</a></div><img alt="Teacher and LMS page system overview" height="1024" src="{{{pix_showcase_page_system}}}" width="1536"/></article>
<article class="experience-slide"><div class="slide-copy"><span class="slide-number">03</span><span class="role-chip admin">Campus operations</span><h3>Run a secure, scalable digital campus with confidence.</h3><p>Flexible roles, enrolment, reporting, integrations and system health views support institutions of every size.</p><ul><li>User and cohort management</li><li>Reports and scheduled tasks</li><li>Theme and plugin controls</li></ul><a href="{{{url_login_admin}}}">Explore administrator login →</a></div><img alt="Role-based LMS access overview" height="1024" src="{{{pix_showcase_role_experience}}}" width="1536"/></article>
</div>
<div class="slider-controls"><button aria-label="Previous experience" data-prev="" type="button">←</button><div class="slider-dots"><button aria-label="Student experience" class="active" data-slide="0"></button><button aria-label="Teacher experience" data-slide="1"></button><button aria-label="Administrator experience" data-slide="2"></button></div><button aria-label="Next experience" data-next="" type="button">→</button></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="feature-bento section-block">
<div class="section-title reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">Designed for engagement</span><h2>More than a course catalogue</h2></div><p>A complete learning ecosystem with delightful interactions and accessible, responsive foundations.</p></div>
<div class="bento-grid">
<article class="bento-card bento-large reveal"><div><span class="feature-icon">▶</span><h3>Immersive course player</h3><p>Video-first lessons, module playlists, notes, resources and discussions in a focused learning view.</p><a href="{{{url_course_player}}}">Open the course player →</a></div><img alt="Course player interface" height="1024" src="{{{pix_showcase_course_player}}}" width="1536"/></article>
<article class="bento-card bento-dark reveal"><span class="feature-icon">✦</span><h3>Meaningful motivation</h3><p>Streaks, badges, milestones and progress celebrations that encourage consistent learning.</p><div class="streak"><b>12</b><span>day streak</span><i>🔥</i></div></article>
<article class="bento-card reveal"><span class="feature-icon">◫</span><h3>Live and social learning</h3><p>Messages, forums, announcements and collaborative activities keep the campus connected.</p><div class="mini-chat"><span class="chat-avatar">SJ</span><div><b>Dr Sarah</b><small>Great question—let's explore it in class.</small></div></div></article>
<article class="bento-card reveal"><span class="feature-icon">◉</span><h3>Insight without overload</h3><p>Clear dashboards turn participation, completion and outcomes into practical next actions.</p><div class="spark-bars"><i style="height:34%"></i><i style="height:55%"></i><i style="height:42%"></i><i style="height:80%"></i><i style="height:68%"></i><i style="height:94%"></i></div></article>
<article class="bento-card bento-image reveal"><img alt="Multi-role login experience" height="1024" src="{{{pix_showcase_role_experience}}}" width="1536"/><div><span class="feature-icon">⌘</span><h3>Beautifully role-aware</h3><p>Distinct experiences for students, teachers, parents and campus teams—on one secure foundation.</p></div></article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="community-section" id="community">
<div class="community-copy reveal"><span class="eyebrow">A place to belong</span><h2>Build a learning community beyond the classroom.</h2><p>Clubs, mentoring, events, portfolios and peer collaboration help every learner contribute, connect and grow.</p><div class="community-points"><span>✓ Student clubs</span><span>✓ Mentoring spaces</span><span>✓ Digital portfolios</span><span>✓ Campus events</span></div><a class="button" href="{{{url_role_login}}}">Join the community</a></div>
<div class="community-collage reveal"><div class="photo-card photo-one"><span>Project-based learning</span></div><div class="photo-card photo-two"><span>Creative collaboration</span></div><div class="photo-card photo-three"><span>Campus anywhere</span></div></div>
</section>
