</div>
</section>
<section class="final-cta reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">Ready when you are</span><h2>Your next learning experience starts here.</h2><p>Explore public programmes or enter your personalised learning portal.</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="button button-xl" href="{{{url_role_login}}}">Choose your login</a><a class="button ghost button-xl" href="{{{url_all_pages}}}">Browse all 54 layouts</a></div></section>
